Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?#1343=20:=20P2-3=20delta=20=E2=80=94=20un=20run?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20de=20lot=20ne=20mat=C3=A9rialise=20pas=20une=20marque=20full?=
